<td id="mwA6o">posthumously awarded to longtime <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Skeptical_Inquirer" title="Skeptical Inquirer" id="mwA6s">Skeptical Inquirer</a> editor</td>
<td id="mwA6w">"The presentation began with a lovely tribute video, showcasing Frazier's forty-five year history with CSI and Skeptical Inquirer magazine. Free Inquiry editor Paul Fidalgo then took the stage, offering a moving and funny tribute to the man who had been at the helm of Skeptical Inquirer longer than Fidalgo himself has been alive. In all that time, Fidalgo noted, Frazier's enthusiasm for the work and passion for science and skepticism never waned."<sup about="#mwt276" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-80" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-80"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-80" id="mwA60"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA64"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA68">[</span>80<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA7A">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>

