</section><section data-mw-section-id="27" id="mwBUw"><h3 data-mw-wikitext="" id="The_Pantheon_of_Skeptics">The Pantheon of Skeptics</h3>
<p id="mwBU0">In April 2011, the executive council of CSI created The Pantheon of Skeptics, a special roster honoring deceased fellows of the Committee who have made the most outstanding contributions to the causes of science and skepticism. This roster is part of an ongoing effort to provide a sense of history about the modern skeptical movement.<sup about="#mwt332" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Pantheon2020_85-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Pantheon2020"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Pantheon2020-85"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-Pantheon2020-85" id="mwBU4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBU8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBVA">[</span>85<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBVE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

