_ref-95" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBoA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBoE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-95" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha">In 2015, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./James_Lawrence_Powell" title="James Lawrence Powell" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBoI">James Lawrence Powell</a> was named a fellow for the Committee for Skeptical Inquiry.<sup about="#mwt349" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Ten2015_90-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Ten2015"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Ten2015-90"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-Ten2015-90" id="mwBoM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBoQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBoU">[</span>90<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBoY">]</span></span></a></sup> He resigned in March 2022 in protest against the publication of an article in <i id="mwBoc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Skeptical_Inquirer" title="Skeptical Inquirer" id="mwBog">Skeptical Inquirer</a></i> by CSI fellow <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Mark_Boslough" title="Mark Boslough" id="mwBok">Mark Boslough</a> regarding the Bunch et al. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Tall_el-Hammam#Air_burst_claim" title="Tall el-Hammam" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBoo">Tall el-Hammam air burst</a> paper,<sup about="#mwt354" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Pillar_of_Salt_91-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Pillar of Salt"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Pillar_of_Salt-91"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-Pillar_of_Salt-91" id="mwBos"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBow"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBo0">[</span>91<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBo4">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt365" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-92" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-92"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-92" id="mwBo8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBpA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpE">[</span>92<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpI">]</span></span></a></sup> citing a departure by the CSI from "every tenet of proper skepticism".<sup about="#mwt375" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-PowellResignation_93-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"PowellResignation"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-PowellResignation-93"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-PowellResignation-93" id="mwBpM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBpQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpU">[</span>93<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpY">]</span></span></a></sup> However, further research published by Boslough<sup about="#mwt380" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Bos1_94-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Bos1"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Bos1-94"}}'><a href="./Committee_for_Skeptical_Inquiry#cite_note-Bos1-94" id="mwBpc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBpg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpk">[</span>94<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBpo">]</span></span></a></sup> led to <i id="mwBps"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Scientific_Reports" title="Scientific Reports" id="mwBpw">Scientific Reports</a></i> retracting the Bunch et al. paper, indicating this criticism was unfounded.</span></li>
